{"verse": {"id": 2173899, "chapter_id": 4697, "verse_number": "४५", "content_sanskrit": "तदिदं वचनं तेषां सत्करिष्यामि माधव\t॥४५॥", "padaccheda": "", "anvaya": "", "meaning_sanskrit": "", "meaning_english": "", "audio_url": null, "display_order": 51}, "commentaries": [{"id": 1, "verse_id": 2173899, "commentary_type": "ಕನ್ನಡ ಅರ್ಥ", "author": "ಕನ್ನಡ ಅರ್ಥ", "lang": "kn", "content": "ಮಾಧವ! ಇವರ ಮಾತನ್ನು ನಾನಿಂದು ಸತ್ಯವನ್ನಾಗಿ ಮಾಡುತ್ತೇನೆ."}]}